    "entry_markers": "User-specified post-admission directions: Southwest at South 3/4-side 4F lobby; East-bound and circle-ticket origins separately at the 2F main entrance area. These are not waiting areas, exact ticket checkpoints or ticket eligibility guarantees.",
    "outdoor_transfer": "West 1 exit -> road crossing -> East 1-3 rear truck yard -> the selected hall rear gate. Does not return to a side passage or Galleria before arrival.",
    "building_gates": "Separate Galleria-facing and truck-yard-facing gate nodes for each East 1-3 hall. Rear-door facade and two-level Galleria verified against the official East building drawing. Representative door positions, subject to event opening and controls.",
    "floor_connections": "South 2F-4F internal escalator connection and East Galleria 2F walkway with several 1F descent points.",
